<div><a name="_2488ce5c-1264-8bc9-776f-9a5c9b7597d9" id="_2488ce5c-1264-8bc9-776f-9a5c9b7597d9"></a><h3>12.5.4<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>S100_EncodingFormat</h3>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_370e2a60-f138-34cf-901c-7aa9402f1de5" id="_370e2a60-f138-34cf-901c-7aa9402f1de5"></a>S-102 uses S100_EncodingFormat with a restriction on the allowed values to permit only the S-100 HDF5 format for S-102 datasets.</p>

