5255-935a-c25a416afcd1"></a>Enumeration</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_69f0f584-f7b9-4311-5554-7c333c38f3a4" id="_69f0f584-f7b9-4311-5554-7c333c38f3a4"></a>S100_EncodingFormat</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b62e3954-c1e6-259b-311c-2b57206eb8f3" id="_b62e3954-c1e6-259b-311c-2b57206eb8f3"></a>The encoding format</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="center" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: center;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_0b8427bd-4753-7931-60c5-f0da52607f77" id="_0b8427bd-4753-7931-60c5-f0da52607f77"></a>-</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8b9f61e9-dd88-fd39-15e9-c9b789d8bc23" id="_8b9f61e9-dd88-fd39-15e9-c9b789d8bc23"></a>The only value allowed in S-102 is &#x201C;HDF5&#x201D;.</p>
