</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_1b77b4e3-d361-2cea-c067-3d4a8fe1068a" id="_1b77b4e3-d361-2cea-c067-3d4a8fe1068a"></a>S100_CompliancyCategory</p>
