</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_c06d8ed7-c6cf-9aed-9580-f54f9d650517" id="_c06d8ed7-c6cf-9aed-9580-f54f9d650517"></a>Value</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d18ea4c2-cb04-6d18-36df-82767ef9425a" id="_d18ea4c2-cb04-6d18-36df-82767ef9425a"></a>irregular</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e35d2f4f-bcbb-8ef4-8b59-223263c0f615" id="_e35d2f4f-bcbb-8ef4-8b59-223263c0f615"></a>Resource is updated in intervals that are uneven in duration.</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="center" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: center;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_afe9771d-a7bd-65de-7969-4dd53350ae3c" id="_afe9771d-a7bd-65de-7969-4dd53350ae3c"></a>2</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9ec90cad-ba5c-b4e0-c16b-3aac47d8be3d" id="_9ec90cad-ba5c-b4e0-c16b-3aac47d8be3d"></a>Use only for datasets which do not use a regular schedule for update or supersession.<br/> Allowed if and only if userDefinedMaintenanceFrequency is not populated</p>
