        </h1>
        <p style="display:none;" class="variant-title-toc">Annex C<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Portrayal Catalogue</p>
        <div class="Note">
          <a name="_e0b6b3a7-c4e5-6abf-d03a-a71dbd922435" id="_e0b6b3a7-c4e5-6abf-d03a-a71dbd922435"></a>
